          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yikusambila kunyikabu yatachi yayuma yejima, niyákuyuma yimukulambula yejima, niyányilambu yenu yejima, yakekali yambala yawatupristu. Mwakamwinkaŋa kapristu wuŋa wenu wumwakafuŋa wakusambila, kulonda wakashakamishi nkisu hetala deyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.30",
